{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26994","headline":"答韩湘 · 姚合","name":"答韩湘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"疎散无世用，爲文乏天格。\n把笔日不休，忽忽有所得。\n所得良自慰，不求他人识。\n子独访我来，致诗过相饰。\n君子无浮言，此诗应亦直。\n但虑忧我深，鉴亦随之惑。\n子在名场中，屡战还屡北。\n我无数子明，端坐空叹息。\n昨闻过春关，名系吏部籍。\n三十登高科，前涂浩难测。\n诗人多峭冷，如水在胸臆。\n岂随寻常人，五藏爲酒食。\n期来作酬章，危坐吟到夕。\n难爲间其辞，益贵我纸墨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26994.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26994","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}